tps://api.github.com/users/fredbi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredbi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2018-03-09T21:04:13Z","updated_at":"2018-05-10T06:33:57Z","closed_at":"2018-05-07T16:48:16Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Problem statement\r\n\r\nThe generated validation code in model for the following JSON schema constructs is invalid.\r\n\r\nThis testcase is part of the cloudbreak.json spec (see also #910): [here](https://gist.github.com/mhmxs/63060f19ecfbf7c0d375663629701494)\r\n\r\nGiven the following definition:\r\n``` json\r\n\"PlatformGatewaysResponse\" : {\r\n      \"type\" : \"object\",\r\n      \"properties\" : {\r\n        \"gateways\" : {\r\n          \"type\" : \"object\",\r\n          \"additionalProperties\" : {\r\n            \"type\" : \"array\",\r\n            \"uniqueItems\" : true,\r\n            \"items\" : {\r\n              \"$ref\" : \"#/definitions/CloudGatewayJson\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe model generation yields:\r\n```golang\r\n// PlatformGatewaysResponseGateways platform gateways response gateways\r\n// swagger:model platformGatewaysResponseGateways\r\ntype PlatformGatewaysResponseGateways map[string][]CloudGatewayJSON\r\n\r\n// Validate validates this platform gateways response gateways\r\nfunc (m PlatformGatewaysResponseGateways) Validate(formats strfmt.Registry) error {\r\n\tvar res []error\r\n\r\n\tif err := validate.Required(\"\", \"body\", PlatformGatewaysResponseGateways(m)); err != nil {\r\n\t\treturn err\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tfor k := range m {\r\n\r\n\t\tif err := validate.Required(k, \"body\", m[k]); err != nil {\r\n\t\t\treturn err\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tif err := validate.UniqueItems(k, \"body\", m[k]); err != nil {\r\n\t\t\treturn err\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tfor i := 0; i < len(m[k]); i++ {\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif swag.IsZero(m[k][i]) { // not required\r\n\t\t\t\tcontinue\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif m[k][i] != nil {\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tif err := m[k][i].Validate(formats); err != nil {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tif ve, ok := err.(*errors.Validation); ok {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\treturn ve.ValidateName(k + \".\" + strconv.Itoa(i))\r\n\t\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\t\treturn err\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tif len(res) > 0 {\r\n\t\treturn errors.CompositeValidationError(res...)\r\n\t}\r\n\treturn nil\r\n}\r\n``` \r\n\r\nThe `m[k][i] != nil`  is invalid.\r\n\r\nWith type:\r\n```golang\r\n// CloudGatewayJSON cloud gateway Json\r\n// swagger:model CloudGatewayJson\r\ntype CloudGatewayJSON struct {\r\n\r\n\t// id\r\n\tID string `json:\"id,omitempty\"`\r\n\r\n\t// name\r\n\tName string `json:\"name,omitempty\"`\r\n\r\n\t// properties\r\n\r\n```\r\n## Swagger specification\r\n[cloudbreak.json](https://gist.github.com/mhmxs/63060f19ecfbf7c0d375663629701494)\r\n\r\n## Steps to reproduce\r\n```bash\r\nswagger generate server --spec https://gist.github.com/mhmxs/63060f19ecfbf7c0d375663629701494\r\ncd models\r\ngo build\r\n``` \r\n## Environment\r\nswagger version: current master  \r\ngo version: 1.9.1\r\nOS:   linux ubuntu 14..04\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"casualjim","id":456109,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjEwOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/456109?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim","html_url":"https://github.com/casualjim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casualjim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-swagger/go-swagger/issues/1453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-swagger/go-swagger/issues/1453/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}